  "description": "Extends the Hangfire Dashboard with a UI to manually launch jobs, view launch history, manage reusable templates, and maintain an immutable audit log. Supports Fire - Forget, Schedule, Recurring (with Cron generator), and Continuation modes. Resolves types in real-time and offers three recurring engines: Direct, Built‑in (via dispatcher), and DynamicJobs. Includes critical queue confirmation and full pagination for history and audit views.",
